11. Rules Engine

The Rules Engine will decide which sections remain and which sections are removed.

Rule A

Condition:

Testing Failed

AND

Returns Required

Action:

Keep Compliance Failure Paragraph

Else:

Remove

Rule B

Condition:

ADP/ACP

PRIOR Method

Returns Required

Action:

Keep PRIOR Wording

Else remove.

Rule C

Condition:

ADP/ACP

CURRENT Method

Returns Required

Action:

Keep CURRENT Wording

Else remove.

Rule D

Condition:

CURRENT Method

AND

Correction After 12 Months

Action:

Keep After 12 Months Current Wording

Rule E

Condition:

PRIOR Method

AND

Correction After 12 Months

Action:

Keep After 12 Months Prior Wording

Rule F

Condition:

Top Heavy Percent >= 60

Action:

Keep Top Heavy Wording

Else remove.

Rule G

Condition:

No Action Required Items

Action:

Display Green No Action Message

